{'symbol': 'WELL', 'date': '2021-06-29 09:00:00', 'title': 'WELLTOWER CLOSES $500 MILLION SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES OFFERING', 'text': 'TOLEDO, OHIO, JUNE 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WELLTOWER ® INC.\xa0(NYSE: WELL) ("WELLTOWER" OR THE "COMPANY") TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS SUCCESSFULLY CLOSED ITS OFFERING (THE "OFFERING") OF\xa0$500 MILLION IN 2.050% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE\xa0JANUARY 2029.\xa0 WELLTOWER\xa0INTENDS TO USE THE NET PROCEEDS FROM THE OFFERING FOR GENERAL CORPORATE PURPOSES, INCLUDING REPAYMENT OF DEBT AND INVESTING IN HEALTH CARE AND SENIORS HOUSING PROPERTIES.'}